- [CXC-FPIDC-SLOT-INDEX-DESIGN-NOTE] CONTRAST_WITH [CXC-FPIDC-TIER-WORKING-SET]
- [CXC-FPIDC-ENROLL-EVERYWHERE-RBAC-ELSEWHERE] DEPENDS_ON [CXC-FPIDC-RBAC-BY-REACHABILITY]
