### Causal

- [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-CASTING] ENABLES [CXC-FPIDC-RECASTING-MOVES-NO-TEMPLATE]
- [CXC-FPIDC-PUSH-TRIGGER] CAUSES [CXC-FPIDC-DESIRED-STATE-ONLY]
- [CXC-FPIDC-ENROLLMENT-CEREMONY] PRECONDITION_FOR [CXC-FPIDC-CAPTURED-TEMPLATE-GOES-TO-THE-LIBRARY]
- [CXC-FPIDC-CAPTURED-TEMPLATE-GOES-TO-THE-LIBRARY] PRECONDITION_FOR [CXC-FPIDC-PUSH-TRIGGER]

### Temporal

- [CXC-FPIDC-ENROLLMENT-CEREMONY] BEFORE [CXC-FPIDC-CAPTURED-TEMPLATE-GOES-TO-THE-LIBRARY]
- [CXC-FPIDC-CAPTURED-TEMPLATE-GOES-TO-THE-LIBRARY] BEFORE [CXC-FPIDC-PUSH-TRIGGER]

### Entity

- [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-PERSON] OWNED_BY [CXC-FPIDC-TIER-LIBRARY]
- [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-TEMPLATE] OWNED_BY [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-PERSON]
- [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-DEVICE] CONTAINS [CXC-FPIDC-ENTITY-CAPABILITY]

